 This rip plays Vinesauce Joel's cover of the advertised track. At 0:22, the "ooooo" lyric is extended to last much longer, gradually increasing in pitch as it progresses, while the instrumental and backing vocals continue, referencing "Live & Learn - Sonic Adventure 2".     
